gAtoms -- bundled third-party components
=======================================

This package statically links a bundled copy of the igraph C library. No
external igraph installation, shared library, pkg-config file or environment
variable is required to build or use gAtoms.


1. igraph C library
-------------------

  Component:  igraph C library
  Version:    1.0.1
  Location:   src/igraph/include/        public headers
              src/igraph/src/            library sources
              src/igraph/vendor/         bundled third-party dependencies
  License:    GPL (>= 2)   [igraph 1.0.1 is released under GPL-2.0-or-later]
  Copyright:  see inst/licenses/igraph-AUTHORS.txt,
              inst/licenses/igraph-CONTRIBUTORS.md and
              inst/licenses/igraph-ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md
  Homepage:   https://igraph.org/

  The complete igraph 1.0.1 source tree is shipped. It is the official release,
  with one narrowly scoped exception: a compiler-warning cleanup applied to 51
  files under src/igraph/vendor/, described in section 1a below. The only other
  files added by gAtoms are the build description, the small set of
  configuration headers that igraph's own build system normally generates, and a
  one-line forwarding header (see sections 1b and 1c).

